			"notes": "## Features: <img alt=\"MC Version\" align=\"right\" height=28 src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC%20Version-1.18, 1.18.1, 1.18.2-informational?style=flat-square\">\n* Update to minecraft 1.18\n* change timeout file format **(you will need to delete the old timeouts.json due to incompatible formats!)**\n* Add `/pardon-death` command to pardon the last death of a player\n* Add `/unpardon-death` command to revert the pardoning of a death\n* Add `/timeouts` command to see a list of all timeouts registered\n* Add `deathTimeout` gamerule to specify timeout length in seconds\n* Minor changes in localization\n* Made timeouts.json more human readable\n\n### Fixes:\n* Join/left messages are no longer shown when players try to connect with timeouts\n* Probably some other bugs as the codebase was heavily refactored\n\n\n### *Download the server-only mod jar below.*"
		},
